        "sid": "2KI 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nwang’u wot Ahab pier abiro ni Samaria. Man Yehu goro waraga, man eorogi i Samaria, ba jubim mi Yezrel, en e judongo, man ba ju ma tungo wot Ahab, ewacu kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kawono ka waraga maeni tundo i beng’wu, kum wot jadit mu ni kudu, man magali ku riuni ni kudu, kud adhura ma tek bende, man jambali; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wuyeny ng’atu ma ber ma cu i kind wot jadit mu, man wukethe wi komker pa won, wukied de pi ot pa jadit mu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento lworo negogi apila, man giwacu kumae, Nen, ubimo ario gicungo i wang’e ngo: wabilund cungo nenedi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ng’atu ma ni wi juot, ku ng’atu ma ni wi adhurane, man judongo bende, ku ju ma tungo nyithindho, gioro kwenda ba Yehu, giwacu kumae, Wan wa jutic peri, man wabitimo gin ceke m’iwacu iwa; wabiketho ng’atu moko ngo ni ubimo: tim gin m’ubedo ber i weng’i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elund egoro waraga mir arionde igi, ewacu kumae, Tek wubedo jubang’a, man tek wubiwinjo dwanda wugam wi dhanu ma wot jadit mu, man wubin i bang’a i Yezrel urwo unyoni. Nwang’u wot ubimo, ma gi dhanu pier abiro, gini ba dhanu ma weg dwong’ mir adhurane, m’utungogi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre, kinde ma waragane bino i bang’gi, nia gimaku wot ubimo, man ginegogi, en e dhanu pier abiro, man giketho wigi i katoko, e giorogi i bang’e i Yezrel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E jakwenda bino i bang’e, man ewacu ire kumae, Gikelo wi wot ubimo. E ewacu kumae, Wucok dhoggi ni ungu ario i kamondo mi dhugang’ maram kugweno wok ko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E etimbre kugweno nia ewok woko, man ecungo, ewacu de ni dhanu ceke kumae, Wun wu pwe: nen, aporo lembe kum jadit para, man anege; ento ng’a m’ugoyo jumaeni ceke? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wung’ei kawono nia lembe pa Yehova moko mbe ma bidong’, ma Yehova yero pi ot pa Ahab: kum Yehova timo lembe m’eyero ku jatic pare ma Elia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HOS.1.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hos 1:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno Yehu goyo dhanu ceke m’udong’ m’i ot pa Ahab i Yezrel, ku dhanu pare ma weg dwong’ ceke, man jurimbe ma ka cwinye, ku julam pare, maram eweko ko ire moko ngo m’udong’.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E eai ecidho, man ecidho Samaria. Man kan eni ba ot mi nyaru yukrombe mi jukwac i yo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu rombo ku utumin Ahazia m’ubimo mi Yuda, man ewacu kumae, Wu jukani? E giloko lembe kumae, Wan wa utumin Ahazia: man waloro piny kara wamoth nyithindho p’ubimo man nyithindho pa ci ubimo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ewacu kumae, Wumakgi ma kwo. E gimakugi ma kwo, man ginegogi dhu vur mi ot nyaru yukrombe, en e dhanu pier ang’wen wi ario; kadok kindgi moko de eweko ngo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E kinde m’eai ku keca, enwang’u Yehonadab ma wod Rekab m’ubebino rombo kude; man emothe, ewacu ire kumae, Adundeni bedo atira, calu adundena bedo kud adundeni? E Yehonadab uloko lembe kumae, Ebedo kumeno. Tek ebedo kumeno, mi ira cingi. E emio ire cinge; man eting’e malu i bang’e i magali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ewacu kumae, Wacidh wakudi, man inen ngiri para ma pi Yehova. Kum kumeno giketho ewotho ku i magali pare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E kinde m’ebino Samaria, egoyo dhanu ceke m’udong’ i Samaria ma pa Ahab, maram enyothe ko, calku lembe pa Yehova, m’eyero ni Elia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Yehu coko dhanu ceke karacelo, man ewacu igi kumae, Ahab utimo ni Bal nyanok: ento Yehu bitimo ire dit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno kawono wulwong’ jubila pa Bal ceke i bang’a, jurwo pare ceke, ku julam pare ceke; kud wuwek moko dong’: kum abedo ku lam ma dit m’atira ni Bal: ng’atu ma tek ubedo mbe, ebibedo kwo ngo. Ento Yehu time i abombi, kara enyoth jurwo ni Bal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Yehu wacu kumae, Wuyer pi cokri ma dit pi Bal. E giyero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yehu oro kwenda kind Israel ceke: e jurwo pa Bal ceke gibino, ketho nia ng’atu moko mbe m’udong’ ma kubino ngo. E gimondo i ot pa Bal; man ot pa Bal upong’ thur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ewacu ni jawi kakan kendi kumae, Wodh kendi mi jurwo pa Bal ceke. E ewodho kendi woko igi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yehu mondo, giku Yehonadab ma wod Rekab, i ot pa Bal; man ewacu ni jurwo pa Bal kumae, Wuyeny, man wunen nia jutic pa Yehova moko kud ubed keni, ndhu jurwo pa Bal kendgi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E gimondo kara githier lam ku lam m’awang’a. Nwang’u Yehu goyo ire wi dhanu pier abora yo woko, man ewacu kumae, Tek kind dhanu moko m’akelo i cingwu ubothi, ng’atu m’uweko ecidho, kwo pare bibedo pi kwo pa ng’atuca.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre, kinde m’edaru thiero lam m’awang’a nia Yehu wacu ni jukur man ni jego kumae, Wumondi, man wuneggi; kud wuwek moko wok woko. E gigoyogi ku lak palamularu; man jukur ku jego gibayugi woko, e gicidho bang’ adhura mi ot pa Bal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwodho mbegi ma ni i ot pa Bal woko, man giwang’ugi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E girwombo mbegi pa Bal piny, man girwombo ot pa Bal piny, gidwoke de ni odbar, cil i ceng’ ma tin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Yehu nyotho Bal kud i Israel kumeni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
